>> blueCup := CoffeeMachine order: 0.
ਆਉਟਪੁੱਟ ਲਿਖੋ: blueCup, ਨਵੀਂ-ਲਾਈਨ.
>> plasticCup := SimpleCoffeeMachine order.
plasticCup := ['Lemonade']. 
>> blackCup := SimpleCoffeeMachine order.
ਆਉਟਪੁੱਟ ਲਿਖੋ: blackCup, ਨਵੀਂ-ਲਾਈਨ.
blackCup ਅੰਤ-ਵਿੱਚ-ਜੋੜੋ: [' nooo.... beer. '].
>> orangeCup := SimpleCoffeeMachine order.
ਆਉਟਪੁੱਟ ਲਿਖੋ: orangeCup, ਨਵੀਂ-ਲਾਈਨ.
